  DisplayName: Studious Spells
  IconPath: icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp
  Description: 'Your hybrid study grants you additional spells that can enhance your
    power in combat. You gain two special 2nd-rank studious spell slots, which can
    be used to prepare @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gecko Grip], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sure
    Strike], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Breathing], and an additional
    spell depending on your hybrid study. You add any spells from this class feature
    to your spellbook. At 11th level, the extra slots increase to 3rd-rank and you
    add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Haste] and an additional spell depending
    on your hybrid study. At 13th level, the extra slots increase to 4th-rank and
    you add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fly] and an additional spell depending
    on your hybrid study. Aloof Firmament 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water
    Walk]; 11th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Wind]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Variable
    Gravity] Inexorable Iron 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge];
    11th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Earthbind]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Planar
    Tether] Laughing Shadow 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blur]; 11th:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Time Jump]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Translocate]
    Sparkling Targe 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Resist Energy]; 11th:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Warding Aggression]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mountain
    Resilience] Starlit Span 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkvision];
    11th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Wind]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unfettered
    Movement] Twisting Tree 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Embed Message];
    11th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Slow]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Flicker]
    Unfurling Brocade 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Web]; 11th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Whirling
    Scarves]; 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Planar Tether] Resurgent
    Maelstrom 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Walk], 11th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Aqueous
    Orb], 13th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unfettered Movement]'
